  "$1\\,\\text{{@0}} = {@1}\\,\\text{{@2}}$, preto ${@3}\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$. Teda ${@6}\\,\\text{{@7}} = {@8}\\,\\text{{@9}}$.": "$1\\,\\text{{@0}} = {@1}\\,\\text{{@2}}$, donc ${@3}\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$. Ainsi ${@6}\\,\\text{{@7}} = {@8}\\,\\text{{@9}}$.",
